<title>USA: Entergy says acquires Sentry Alarm.</title>
<headline>Entergy says acquires Sentry Alarm.</headline>
<dateline>LITTLE ROCK, Ark. 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Entergy Corp said on Friday that it had acquired Sentry Alarm Systems of America Inc for about $41 million.</p>
<p>Clearwater, Fla.- based Sentry is a full service security monitoring company with annual revenues of about $22 million, Entergy said.</p>
